{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44546","headline":"诗三百三首 二四三 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二四三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有六兄弟，就中一个恶。\n打伊又不得，駡伊又不着。\n处处无奈何，耽财好淫杀。\n见好埋头爱，贪心过罗刹。\n阿爷恶见伊，阿娘嫌不悦。\n昨被我捉得，恶駡恣情掣。\n趂向无人处，一一向伊说。\n汝今须改行，覆车须改辙。\n若也不信受，共汝恶合杀。\n汝受我调伏，我共汝觅活。\n从此尽和同，如今过菩萨。\n学业攻鑪冶，链尽三山铁。\n至今静恬恬，衆人皆赞说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}